# Pairs with OnlyMetaToolUngated. AuthorizedMetaTool does not re-run the gate,
# so lattice_list_regions is served on a call the gate refuses.
MODULE: RegionsGatedOnlyAtAdvertisement
TARGET: OnlyMetaToolUngated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the region-discovery tool is gated at advertisement only
PERTURBS: CallRegions

--- FIND
        res == IF ~adv THEN "notFound" ELSE IF ~g THEN "denied" ELSE IF held THEN "ok" ELSE "denied"
--- REPLACE
        res == IF ~adv THEN "notFound" ELSE IF held THEN "ok" ELSE "denied"
--- END
